- Every pre-existing `dart:io` file under `lib/src/` is exported through `lib/io.dart` (the platform entry point), NOT through the pure barrel `lib/flutter_agent_harness.dart`. Files like `io_mcp_transport.dart`, `local_hub.dart`, `file_agent_telemetry_sink.dart` etc. — all reachable only via `lib/io.dart`.
- `provider_common.dart` (pre-existing) does NOT import dart:io — it only mentions it in comments. Good.
- The PR adds TWO `dart:io` files (`conn_trace.dart`, `stall_sentinel.dart`) and exports BOTH through the PURE barrel `lib/flutter_agent_harness.dart`:

